            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-2">Recovery/धमकी वाले call</td>
              <td class="border border-gray-300 px-4 py-2">नज़दीकी police station में लिखित शिकायत; recovery के नियम हमारी <a class="text-blue-700 underline" href="/article/rbi-loan-recovery-rules-2027-borrower-rights/">loan recovery guide</a> में</td>
